wn as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may add {C}{C}. You can't spend this mana to cast spells.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may ask target player a yes-or-no question. If you do, that player answers the question truthfully and abides by that answer if able until end of turn.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may cast a permanent spell from your hand with mana value equal to 1 plus the highest mana value among other permanents you control without paying its mana cost. If you don't, scry 1.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may choose a card type. If you do, each player sacrifices a permanent of that type.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may create a 1/1 green Squirrel creature token.\\nThreshold — Squirrel creatures get +2/+2 as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exchange control of Conjured Currency and target permanent you neither own nor control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exchange control of target nonland permanent you control and target nonland permanent an opponent controls with an equal or lesser mana value.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile Cosima. If you do, it gains "Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, if Cosima is exiled, you may put a voyage counter on it. If you don\'t, return Cosima to the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it and draw X cards, where X is the number of voyage counters on it."', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile a card from a graveyard. If a creature card was exiled this way, put a +1/+1 counter on Deathbonnet Hulk.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile a creature card from a graveyard. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Entrails Feaster. If you don't