l.)", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nCreatures you control gain reach until end of turn. (They can block creatures with flying.)", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nCreatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nDestroy target attacking creature.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nDestroy target nonblack attacking creature.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to you this turn by attacking creatures.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nReturn one or two target attacking creatures to their owner's hand.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nReturn target attacking creature to its owner's hand.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nScorching Winds deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nTarget creature gets +1/+3 until end of turn. Untap that creature.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nThis turn, whenever an attacking creature deals combat damage to you, it deals that much damage to its controller.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\\nUntap all creatures you control.", 'Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step.\\nAttacking creatures you control get +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the number of attacki