ling (This card is every creature type.)\\nTarget creature gets +3/-3 and loses all creature types until end of turn.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nTrample', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nUntil end of turn, target creature has base power and toughness 4/4, gains all creature types, and gains flying.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nUp to two target creatures each get +2/+0 and gain all creature types until end of turn.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nVigilance', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhen Graveshifter enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhen Guardian Gladewalker enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhen Irregular Cohort enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 colorless Shapeshifter creature token with changeling.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhen Littjara Kinseekers enters the battlefield, if you control three or more creatures that share a creature type, put a +1/+1 counter on Littjara Kinseekers, then scry 1.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhen Masked Vandal enters the battlefield, you may exile a creature card from your graveyard. If you do, exile target artifact or enchantment an opponent controls.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhenever an opponent casts a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Taurean Mauler.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhenever another creature named Gladewalker Ritualist enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhenever you or a permanent you control becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter that spell or ability unless its controller pays {1}.', "Changeling (This card is