e card, exile that creature card instead.)\\nCreature cards in your graveyard have haste.', "Creature spells can't be cast.\\nPay 4 life: Destroy Aether Storm. It can't be regenerated. Any player may activate this ability.", "Creature spells can't be countered.", 'Creature spells cost {2} less to cast.\\nWhenever chaos ensues, reveal the top three cards of your library. Put all creature cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Creature spells cost {2} more to cast.', 'Creature spells you cast cost up to {2} less to cast.', 'Creature spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Krallenhorde Howler.', 'Creature spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Marauding Raptor deals 2 damage to it. If a Dinosaur is dealt damage this way, Marauding Raptor gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Creature spells you cast cost {1} more to cast.', 'Creature spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.\\nCreatures you control get -1/-1.', 'Creature spells you cast cost {B} less to cast. This effect reduces only the amount of colored mana you pay.', 'Creature spells you cast from your hand have blitz {3}. (If you cast a spell for its blitz cost, it gains haste and "When this creature dies, draw a card." Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.)\\nWhenever chaos ensues, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Creature spells you cast have sticker kicker {1}. (You may pay an additional {1} as you cast a creature spell. If you do, you get {TK}, then you may put a sticker on it.)', 'Creature spells you cast that share a creature type with Mistform Warchief cost {1} less to cast.\\n{T}: Mistform Warchief becomes the creature type of your choice until end of turn.', 'Creature spells you cast with mana value 6 or greater cost {2} less to cast.', 'Creature spells you cast with power