hanted permanent.\\nEnchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", "Enchant artifact or creature\\nWhen Weakstone's Subjugation enters the battlefield, you may pay {3}. If you do, tap enchanted permanent.\\nEnchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchant artifact or enchantment\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, choose one —\\n• Destroy enchanted permanent.\\n• You gain 2 life.', 'Enchant artifact or land\\nEnchanted permanent has "{T}: Target player adds two mana of any one color. The next spell they cast this turn has cascade." (When they cast their next spell, they exile cards from the top of their library until they exile a nonland card that costs less. They may cast it without paying its mana cost. They put the exiled cards on the bottom in a random order.)', "Enchant artifact you control\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, create a token that's a copy of enchanted artifact. Then if you control eight or more artifacts with the same name as one another, you win the game.", "Enchant artifact, creature, or planeswalker\\nEnchanted permanent can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Enchant artifact\\nAs long as enchanted artifact isn't a creature, it's an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to its mana value.", "Enchant artifact\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted artifact's controller, Curse Artifact deals 2 damage to that player unless they sacrifice that artifact.", "Enchant artifact\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted artifact's controller, Warp Artifact deals 1 damage to that player.", "Enchant artifact\\nAt the beginning of your end step, Gremlin Infestation deals 2 damage to enchanted artifact's controller.\\nWhen enchanted artifact is put into a graveyard, create a 2/2 red Gremlin creature token.", "Enchant artifact\\nEnchanted artifact can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Enchant artifact\\nEnc