s.\\nWhen Omarthis dies, manifest a number of cards from the top of your library equal to the number of counters on it.', "Omenport Vigilante has double strike as long as you've committed a crime this turn. (Targeting opponents, anything they control, and/or cards in their graveyards is a crime.)", 'Once during each of your turns, you may cast a spell from among cards in your graveyard that were milled this turn.\\n{T}: Each player mills a card. (They each put the top card of their library into their graveyard.)', 'Once during each of your turns, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from your graveyard by sacrificing a creature in addition to paying its other costs. If a spell cast this way would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.', 'Ondu Skyruins enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.', 'One or more target creatures become black until end of turn.', 'One or more target creatures become blue until end of turn.', 'One or more target creatures become green until end of turn.', 'One or more target creatures become red until end of turn.', 'One or more target creatures become white until end of turn.', 'One or two target creatures each gain haste until end of turn. For each of those creatures, create a Monster Role token attached to it. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.)', "One or two target creatures each gain haste until end of turn. They can't be blocked this turn except by creatures with haste.\\nEscape—{2}{U}{R}, Exile four other cards from your graveyard. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its escape cost.)", 'One or two target creatures gain flying until end of turn.', "Oozes you control get +1/+1.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a commander, create a token that's a copy of Biowaste Blob.", 'Open Fire deals 3 damage to any target.', "Open a sealed Magic booster pack, reveal the cards, and put all creature cards revealed this way 