sts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)", "Ripple 4 (When you cast this spell, you may reveal the top four cards of your library. You may cast spells with the same name as this spell from among those cards without paying their mana costs. Put the rest on the bottom of your library.)\\nReturn target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Ripple 4 (When you cast this spell, you may reveal the top four cards of your library. You may cast spells with the same name as this spell from among those cards without paying their mana costs. Put the rest on the bottom of your library.)\\nSurging Flame deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Ripple 4 (When you cast this spell, you may reveal the top four cards of your library. You may cast spells with the same name as this spell from among those cards without paying their mana costs. Put the rest on the bottom of your library.)\\nTarget player discards a card.', "Risen Executioner can't block.\\nOther Zombie creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nYou may cast Risen Executioner from your graveyard if you pay {1} more to cast it for each other creature card in your graveyard.", 'Rivendell enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a legendary creature.\\n{T}: Add {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Scry 2. Activate only if you control a legendary creature.', "River Darter can't be blocked by Dinosaurs.", "River Delta doesn't untap during your untap step if it has a depletion counter on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, remove a depletion counter from River Delta.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}. Put a depletion counter on River Delta.", "River Serpent can't attack unless there are five or more cards in your graveyard.\\nCycling {U} ({U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", "River Sneak can't be blocked.\\nWhenever another Merfolk enters the battlefield under your control, River Sneak gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'Riveteers Decoy must be blocked if able.\\nBlitz {3}{G} (If you cast this spell for its blitz cost, it gains haste 