als 3 damage to each creature not chosen this way.\\n20 | Thunderwave deals 6 damage to each creature your opponents control.', 'Roll a six-sided die. Assemble a number of Contraptions equal to the result. (To assemble a Contraption, put the top card of your Contraption deck face up onto one of your sprockets.)', 'Roll a six-sided die. Create a number of 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens equal to the result.', 'Roll a six-sided die. If you roll a 1, Goblin Tutor has no effect. Otherwise, search your library for the indicated card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\n2 — A card named Goblin Tutor\\n3 — An enchantment\\n4 — An artifact\\n5 — A creature\\n6 — An instant or sorcery', "Roll a six-sided die. Put target nonland permanent into its owner's library just beneath the top X cards of that library, where X is the result.", 'Roll a six-sided die. Strategy, Schmategy has the indicated effect.\\n1 — Do nothing.\\n2 — Destroy all artifacts.\\n3 — Destroy all lands.\\n4 — Strategy, Schmategy deals 3 damage to each creature and each player.\\n5 — Each player discards their hand and draws seven cards.\\n6 — Repeat this process two more times.', 'Roll a six-sided die. Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the result.', 'Roll three six-sided dice. For each different result, create a 1/1 white Clown Robot artifact creature token.', 'Roll two d10 and choose one result. Return a creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to that result. Then each opponent loses X life and you gain X life, where X is the other result.', 'Roll two d12 and choose one result. Reckless Endeavor deals damage equal to that result to each creature. Then create a number of Treasure tokens equal to the other result.', 'Roll two d4 and choose one result. Create a number of 3/3 green Beast creature tokens equal to that result. Then search your library for a number of basic land cards equal to the other result, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Roll two d6 and choose one result. Destroy each creature with power greater than or equal to that result. Then create a number of 2/2 white Knight creature tokens with vigilance equal to the other result.', 'Roll two d8 and choose one result. Draw cards equal to that result. Then you may cast an instant or sorcery spell with mana value less than or equal to the other result from your hand without paying its mana cost.', "Roll two six-sided dice. Return any number of cards with total mana value X or less from your graveyard to your hand, where X is the total of those results. Exile Pair o' Dice Lost.", 'Rolling Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without horsemanship and each player.', 'Rolling Temblor deals 2 damage to each creature without flying.\\nFlashback {4}{R}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', "Ronom Serpent can't attack unless defending player controls a snow land.\\nWhen you control no snow lands, sacrifice Ronom Serpent.", 'Room abilities of dungeons you own trigger an additional time.', 'Rootbound Crag enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Mountain or a Forest.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', "Rose Tyler gets +1/+1 for each time counter on it.\\nBad Wolf — Whenever Rose Tyler attacks, put a time counter on it for each suspended card you own and each other permanent you control with a time counter on it.\\nDoctor's companion (You can have two commanders if the other is the Doctor.)", "Rot Farm Skeleton can't block.\\n{2}{B}{G}, Mill four cards: Return Rot Farm Skeleton from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Rotating Fireplace enters the battlefield tapped with a time counter on it.\\n{T}: Add an amount of {C} equal to the number of time counters on Rotating Fireplace.\\n{4}, {T}: Time travel. Activate only as a sorcery. (For each s