 onto the battlefield.', 'Seek a basic land card and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then seek a permanent card with mana value equal to the number of lands you control.', "Seek a card with mana value 2 or less and a card with mana value 3 or greater. Discard those cards at the beginning of your next turn's end step.", 'Seek a nonland artifact card with mana value X or less and put it onto the battlefield. If a card with mana value less than X is put onto the battlefield this way, this spell perpetually gains "This spell costs {1} more to cast," then return this spell to its owner\'s hand.', 'Seek three nonland cards, then nonland cards in your hand perpetually gain "This spell costs {1} less to cast."', 'Seek two cards. You may shuffle them into your library. If you do, seek two cards.\\nYou have no maximum hand size for the rest of the game.', 'Seek two creature cards from among the top ten cards of your library, then shuffle. Creature cards in your hand perpetually get +1/+1.', 'Seek two nonland cards, then put a card from your hand on the bottom of your library.', 'Seismic Rupture deals 2 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Seismic Shudder deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Seismic Strike deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Seismic Wave deals 2 damage to any target and 1 damage to each nonartifact creature target opponent controls.', 'Sejiri Glacier enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.', 'Sejiri Refuge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Sejiri Refuge enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Sejiri Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Sejiri Steppe enters the battlefield, target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\n{T}: Add {W}.', "Sekki, Seasons' Guide enters the battlefield with eight +1/+1 counters on it.\\nIf damage would be dealt to Sekki, prevent that damage, remove that many +1/+1 counter