azda Snare Squad attacks, you may pay {W}. If you do, tap target creature an opponent controls.', 'Whenever Haazda Vigilante enters the battlefield or attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control with power 2 or less.', 'Whenever Hada Freeblade or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Hada Freeblade.', 'Whenever Hagra Diabolist or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target player lose life equal to the number of Allies you control.', 'Whenever Halimar Excavator or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, target player mills X cards, where X is the number of Allies you control.', 'Whenever Hamlet Captain attacks or blocks, other Humans you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Hammer of Nazahn or another Equipment enters the battlefield under your control, you may attach that Equipment to target creature you control.\\nEquipped creature gets +2/+0 and has indestructible.\\nEquip {4}', "Whenever Hans Eriksson attacks, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield tapped and attacking defending player or a planeswalker they control. Otherwise, put that card into your hand. When you put a creature card onto the battlefield this way, it fights Hans Eriksson.", 'Whenever Hanweir Garrison attacks, create two 1/1 red Human creature tokens that are tapped and attacking.\\n(Melds with Hanweir Battlements.)', 'Whenever Hapatra, Vizier of Poisons deals combat damage to a player, you may put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.\\nWhenever you put one or more -1/-1 counters on a creature, create a 1/1 green Snake creature token with deathtouch.', 'Whenever Hardened Berserker attacks, the next spell you cast this turn costs {1} less to cast.', 'Whenever Hasran Ogress attacks, it deals 3 damage to you unless you pay {2}.', 'Whenever Haunted Cadaver deals combat damage to a player, you may sacrifice it. If you do, that 