ls damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a -1/-1 counter on each nonblack creature.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nInescapable Brute must be blocked if able.', "Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nPuncture Blast deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nWhen Lockjaw Snapper dies, put a -1/-1 counter on each creature with a -1/-1 counter on it.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nWhenever Slinking Giant blocks or becomes blocked, it gets -3/-0 until end of turn.', "Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nWhenever Stigma Lasher deals damage to a player, that player can't gain life for the rest of the game.", 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls with a -1/-1 counter on it dies, you may return that card to the battlefield under your control.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Cinderbones.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\n{1}{G}: Twinblade Slasher gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\n{2}{R}, {Q}: Hateflayer deals damage equal to its power to any target. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\n{R/W}: Duergar Cave-Guard gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Witherbloom Campus enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.\\n{4}, {T}: Scry 1.',