 of your library, put all but one of them on the bottom of your library in a random order, then draw a card. X can't be 0.", '{X}, {T}: Untap X target lands.', '{X}, {T}: You gain X life.', "{X}, {T}: You may exile a nonland card from your hand. You may cast that card for as long as it remains exiled. Put a charge counter on Ice Cauldron and note the type and amount of mana spent to pay this activation cost. Activate only if there are no charge counters on Ice Cauldron.\\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Ice Cauldron: Add Ice Cauldron's last noted type and amount of mana. Spend this mana only to cast the last card exiled with Ice Cauldron.", '{X}: Chimeric Staff becomes an X/X Construct artifact creature until end of turn.', '{X}: Choose a creature type. Until end of turn, creatures you control of the chosen type have base power and toughness X/X and gain all creature types.', '{X}: Crypt Rats deals X damage to each creature and each player. Spend only black mana on X.', '{X}: Equipped creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.\\nEquip {1}', '{X}: Jaya Ballard Avatar deals an amount of damage chosen at random from 0 to X to any target. Activate only once each turn.', '{X}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature with fewer than X +1/+1 counters on it.', '{X}: Testament of Faith becomes an X/X Wall creature with defender in addition to its other types until end of turn.', "{X}: You may choose a creature card in your hand whose mana cost could be paid by some amount of, or all of, the mana you spent on {X}. If you do, you may cast that card face down as a 2/2 creature spell without paying its mana cost. If the creature that spell becomes as it resolves has not been turned face up and would assign or deal damage, be dealt damage, or become tapped, instead it's turned face up and assigns or deals damage, is dealt damage, or becomes tapped. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{X}{1}, {T}: Put X charge counters on Ventifact Bottle. Activate only as a sorcery.\\nAt the beginning of your precombat main phase, if Ventifact Bottle has a charge counter on it, tap it and remove all charge counters from it. Add {C} for each charge counter removed this way.', '{X}{1}: Chimeric Coils becomes an X/X Construct artifact creature. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.', '{X}{B/P}: Remove up to X counters from target permanent. For each counter removed this way, Hex Parasite gets +1/+0 until end of turn. ({B/P} can be paid with either {B} or 2 life.)', '{X}{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', '{X}{B}, {T}, Discard two cards: Target player discards X cards at random.', '{X}{B}, {T}: Target player reveals X cards from their hand and you choose one of them. That player discards that card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, the Sky Asunder deals X damage to target creature with flying.\\nChannel — {X}{G}{G}, Discard Arashi: Arashi deals X damage to each creature with flying.', '{X}{G}{G}, {T}, Discard a card: X target lands become Forests until end of turn.', "{X}{G}{G}: Put X +1/+1 counters on target land you control. That land becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.", "{X}{G}{G}{G}: Monstrosity X. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put X +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nAs long as Domesticated Hydra is monstrous, it has trample.", '{X}{R}, Sacrifice Pain Kami: It deals X damage to target creature.', '{X}{R}, {T}, Discard a card: Destroy all artifacts with mana value X or less.', '{X}{R}, {T}, Discard two cards: Latulla, Keldon Overseer deals X damage to any target.', '{X}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Cinder Elemental: It deals X damage to any target.', '{X}{R}, {T}: Jiwari, the Earth Aflame deals X damage to target creature without flying.\\nChannel — {X}{R}{R}{R}, Discard Jiwari: Jiwari deals X damage to each creature without flying.', "{X}{R}: This turn, creatures can't block unless their controller pays {X} for each blocking creature they control.", "{X}{U}, {T}, Discard two cards: Return X target creatures to their owners' hands.", "{X}{U}: This turn, creatures can't attack unless their controller pays {X} for each attacking creature they control.", "{X}{U}{R}, {T}: Nin, the Pain Artist deals X damage to target creature. That creature's controller draws X cards.", "{X}{U}{U}, {T}: Return target creature with mana value X to its owner's hand.\\nGrandeur — Discard another card named Linessa, Zephyr Mage: Target player returns a creature they control to its owner's hand, then repeats this process for an artifact, an enchantment, and a land.", '{X}{W}, {T}: Ballista Squad deals X damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{X}{X}, {T}: Prevent the next X damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{X}{X}, {T}: Target player mills X cards.\\nMorph {3} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', '{X}{X}{1}, {T}: Tap X target lands.', '{X}{X}{1}: Destroy target artifact or creature with mana value X.', '{X}{X}{1}: Destroy target noncreature artifact with mana value X.', '{X}{X}{B}: Destroy target nonblack creature with mana value X.', "{X}{X}{G}: Monstrosity X. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put X +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nWhen Hydra Broodmaster becomes monstrous, create X X/X green Hydra creature tokens.", "{X}{X}{G}: Monstrosity X. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put X +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nWhen Polukranos, World Eater becomes monstrous, it deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures your opponents control. Each of those creatures deals damage equal to its power to Polukranos.", '{X}{X}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Orcish Settlers: Destroy X target lands.']
